{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":496568,"name":"","username":"David.J","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/david.j/{size}/121241_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-21T03:34:11.577Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-496568-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-496568-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-496568-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-496568-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHi,\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI found out that since the last update on Grok Bot (for Mac), the agents “labels / chips” disappeared: I can only set its name, instruction, voice options.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBut no label anymore. And, those are not showing on the side bar neither.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis feature is still available on my account and Grok Bot app on iOS.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAny idea? Someone else have the same issue?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThank you.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-496568-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-496568-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOpen Grok Bot on Mac, version 0.57.1\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-496568-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-496568-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eShow the agent label beside its name.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-496568-operating-system-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-496568-operating-system-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMacOS\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-496568-version-information-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-496568-version-information-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVersion 0.57.1\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-496568-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-496568-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo - Cursor works, but with this issue\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-21T03:34:22.397Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":8,"reads":3,"readers_count":2,"score":40.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":172461,"topic_slug":"agent-label-chip-not-showing-anymore-mac-v0-57-1","display_username":"","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":138401,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/agent-label-chip-not-showing-anymore-mac-v0-57-1/172461/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":496727,"name":"Colin","username":"Colin","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/colin/{size}/90452_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-21T08:41:38.656Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/david.j\"\u003e@David.J\u003c/a\u003e, thanks for the report.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis one is intentional rather than something going wrong on your end. In the latest Grok Bot desktop update (0.57) the team removed the label field and the label chips from the desktop app while they rethink how bots should be described in the sidebar. The iOS app has not made that change yet, which is why you still see labels there.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNothing has been deleted: the labels you already set are still stored with your bots, and the iOS app can still show and edit them.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI have passed your feedback along to the team. If you can share a bit about how you were using the labels (for example to tell similar bots apart in the sidebar), that helps them decide what comes next!\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":5,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-21T08:41:38.656Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":3,"readers_count":2,"score":0.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":172461,"topic_slug":"agent-label-chip-not-showing-anymore-mac-v0-57-1","display_username":"Colin","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"Community Support Engineer","title_is_group":false,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":87436,"hidden":false,"trust_level":3,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/agent-label-chip-not-showing-anymore-mac-v0-57-1/172461/5","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answe